and the harder I try, the more I realize

00:36:13.570 --> 00:36:15.550
the only thing I can call the aayah is what?

00:36:16.830 --> 00:36:19.350
Aayah. The only thing I can call the surah is what?

00:36:20.130 --> 00:36:20.750
a surah.

00:36:21.130 --> 00:36:22.350
Just on its own.

00:36:22.830 --> 00:36:23.840
It's unique.

00:36:24.730 --> 00:36:26.650
So these are the aayat of the Quran.

00:36:26.660 --> 00:36:31.270
So this this was my basic introduction to why the Quran, as literature is unique.

00:36:31.270 --> 00:36:33.260
The surah cannot be compared to anything else.

00:36:33.270 --> 00:36:36.250
The aayah cannot be compared to anything else and in

00:36:36.250 --> 00:36:38.460
the macro studies we'll even look at the word Quran.

