00:50:04.360 --> 00:50:06.880
They say we have the world's greatest something,

00:50:08.060 --> 00:50:11.180
but the Arabs had, "We have the world's greatest...oh, what do we have?"

00:50:13.670 --> 00:50:14.390
Language.

00:50:15.960 --> 00:50:17.490
So they became proud of their

00:50:18.060 --> 00:50:20.880
language. Because if you look around, there's not much else to be proud of.

00:50:22.460 --> 00:50:24.320
So they really took care of their language

00:50:24.320 --> 00:50:26.390
because when a nation becomes proud of something,

00:50:26.400 --> 00:50:27.490
they really take care of it,

00:50:28.460 --> 00:50:29.390
they really take care of it.

00:50:29.760 --> 00:50:31.280
Now let's take a step further.

00:50:32.660 --> 00:50:35.570
You understand why Arabic was so refined and so developed?

00:50:36.660 --> 00:50:38.490
It got so refined and so developed

00:50:39.260 --> 00:50:43.490
that they, man, the way they used to think. It's fascinating.

00:50:43.490 --> 00:50:45.890
I'll just give you one example. I don't want to give you lots of examples.

00:50:45.890 --> 00:50:48.700
Just one example. To make this point, how refined it was.

00:50:48.710 --> 00:50:50.270
I'll tell you the story of a poet.

00:50:51.460 --> 00:50:54.490
This guy was really poor. He didn't have any money

00:50:55.460 --> 00:50:56.310
and he was married.

00:50:59.260 --> 00:51:01.960
