00:51:02.860 --> 00:51:03.390
Money.

00:51:04.360 --> 00:51:05.680
So he made a poem

00:51:06.060 --> 00:51:07.080
to answer his wife.

00:51:09.260 --> 00:51:10.244
And in the poem, he said,

00:51:10.254 --> 00:51:12.864
فَالسَّيلُ حَرْبٌ عَلَى مَكَانٍ عَالِ

00:51:12.864 --> 00:51:14.875
Hehe, strange poem. He says,

00:51:14.880 --> 00:51:15.980
heavy rain.

00:51:16.560 --> 00:51:18.201
Listen to the English. It sounds crazy. Heavy rain is at war

00:51:18.224 --> 00:51:24.636
Heavy rain is at war against a house ontop of a hill.

00:51:25.960 --> 00:51:27.620
I know that sounds insane. I'll say that again.

00:51:27.630 --> 00:51:30.690
Heavy rain is having a war. Against who?

00:51:31.660 --> 00:51:33.450
Against a house. And where's the house?

00:51:34.160 --> 00:51:35.080
On top of a hill.

00:51:36.560 --> 00:51:38.890
I know you're poor. You're also insane.

00:51:39.960 --> 00:51:41.070
You understand? Like,

00:51:41.660 --> 00:51:44.270
but this was actually his genius. He was speaking code.

00:51:44.960 --> 00:51:46.070
Let me decode it for you.

00:51:47.960 --> 00:51:49.190
Imagine there's heavy rain.

00:51:50.160 --> 00:51:51.180
Imagine there's a hill.

00:51:51.760 --> 00:51:54.280
There's a mountain and on top of the mountain there is a

00:51:54.660 --> 00:51:55.290
house.

00:51:55.610 --> 00:51:58.370
When it's raining. Where does the water go? Does it stay on the top?

00:51:58.370 --> 00:51:59.390
Or does it go to the bottom?

00:52:00.350 --> 00:52:02.200
It goes to the bottom of the hill. Yes?

00:52:02.350 --> 00:52:03.980
So it floods the bottom.

00:52:04.350 --> 00:52:08.250
But the house, it attacks the house. But it never stays there.

00:52:08.260 --> 00:52:11.480
The attacks all failed because the only flood that happens is

00:52:11.850 --> 00:52:16.910
at the bottom. The poet is saying wealth comes from Allah. Wealth comes from the sky.

00:52:16.920 --> 00:52:21.190
But I'm a high person. Whenever wealth comes to me, it leaves me.

00:52:21.200 --> 00:52:24.380
And the people that are wealthy are down there in the flood. In the mud.

00:52:24.750 --> 00:52:29.145
[laughs]

00:52:29.750 --> 00:52:30.680
They had a code.

00:52:31.950 --> 00:52:33.380
They spoke in code, man.

00:52:34.150 --> 00:52:34.930
And it's funny.

00:52:34.930 --> 00:52:37.380
It's sometimes really funny and sometimes really, like,

00:52:37.380 --> 00:52:41.060
fascinating how creative they were in the code that they developed.

00:52:41.070 --> 00:52:44.620
But you know what happened when Islam became victorious? Let's fast forward.

00:52:44.630 --> 00:52:46.140
