00:55:13.040 --> 00:55:15.670
Kuala Lumpur probably has much worse. I guarantee it.

00:55:16.040 --> 00:55:16.850
Why?

00:55:17.740 --> 00:55:20.670
People are coming in from the outside. Foreign influence. You understand?

00:55:21.540 --> 00:55:22.960
So now Arabic starts going down.

