I said,

00:56:15.130 --> 00:56:16.450
what happened here?

00:56:17.230 --> 00:56:18.660
You know, because the,

00:56:19.030 --> 00:56:22.540
even in Pakistan the Urdu of 20 years ago is not the Urdu now. It's gone.

00:56:23.630 --> 00:56:25.460
So the people from back then don't speak

00:56:25.460 --> 00:56:27.470
the language that they speak now. It's deteriorated,

00:56:27.470 --> 00:56:28.160
