00:56:28.830 --> 00:56:32.040
So now, having said that, let me tell you, even the Sahaba noticed.

00:56:32.630 --> 00:56:33.250
Did you know that?

00:56:34.130 --> 00:56:36.740
Even the Sahaba noticed that Arabic is going down.

00:56:37.930 --> 00:56:40.730
There's an interesting narration of Ali (رضي الله عنه).

00:56:40.730 --> 00:56:44.850
He was walking by and he saw some kids playing with each other.

