00:56:51.030 --> 00:56:53.250
هَذَا لَيسَ لِسَانَ العَرَب

00:56:54.610 --> 00:56:55.960
This is not the language of the Arabs.

00:56:57.230 --> 00:56:58.140
They're talking to each other,

00:56:58.150 --> 00:57:02.150
Arab kids talking to each other in Arabic and he's saying, that's not Arabic.

