00:57:06.530 --> 00:57:07.750
It's crazy.

00:57:08.430 --> 00:57:12.587
The state of emergency, was being noticed by people like Umar (رضي الله عنه),

00:57:12.587 --> 00:57:13.687
Ali (رضي الله تعالى عنه).

00:57:13.710 --> 00:57:15.050
There are narrations about this.

00:57:15.430 --> 00:57:17.050
Arabic is going down.

00:57:17.060 --> 00:57:18.140
Therefore,

00:57:18.150 --> 00:57:21.510
there were actually, now I'm at the conclusion of this introduction,

00:57:21.520 --> 00:57:23.700
