The three protection movements. There was the movement to protect the Quran.

00:57:28.130 --> 00:57:29.960
There was the movement to protect Hadith.

00:57:31.530 --> 00:57:33.240
And there was the movement to protect Arabic.

00:57:34.330 --> 00:57:35.310
There were three movements.

00:57:36.330 --> 00:57:39.090
Most of the time people know about two movements. Which two movements?

00:57:39.990 --> 00:57:42.240
The movement to protect the Quran and the movement to protect

00:57:42.730 --> 00:57:45.250
Hadith. But they don't really remember the movement to protect

00:57:45.730 --> 00:57:46.430
Arabic.

00:57:46.440 --> 00:57:47.880
How do you protect Arabic,

00:57:47.880 --> 00:57:52.660
though? All the big cities of Islam are getting contaminated by foreigners.

00:57:52.670 --> 00:57:55.590
So you cannot get good Arabic in the cities anymore.

00:57:55.600 --> 00:58:01.210
If you want to get the good, clean, old, unfiltered, uncontaminated Arabic,

00:58:01.220 --> 00:58:02.830
you must go to the

00:58:03.320 --> 00:58:04.150
villages.

00:58:04.160 --> 00:58:06.620
You must go out in the desert that's still empty,

00:58:06.630 --> 00:58:09.320
