00:58:19.000 --> 00:58:19.850
and you think, Oh,

00:58:19.850 --> 00:58:22.230
they traveled in the desert because of taqwa, because they didn't

00:58:22.230 --> 00:58:24.510
want to be in the city because it was too مُلَيَّت.

00:58:25.520 --> 00:58:26.650
You know?

00:58:27.220 --> 00:58:27.910
No, no, no.

