00:59:26.720 --> 00:59:27.950
And you don't care.

00:59:28.820 --> 00:59:32.480
But this man was really nice to me because nobody else knew me in the village.

00:59:32.490 --> 00:59:36.650
He took me in. He brought me to his house. He asked his wife to cook for me.

00:59:38.220 --> 00:59:41.550
So his wife was cooking for him and she brought the food.

00:59:41.550 --> 00:59:46.250
