and those glasses have a little bit of dirt on them.

01:01:20.510 --> 01:01:21.640
When you put those glasses on

01:01:22.410 --> 01:01:24.330
and you don't even realize they have dirt on them,

01:01:25.910 --> 01:01:27.320
everything you see looks what?

