You think it's a dirt on what you

01:01:54.410 --> 01:01:55.130
see.

01:01:55.510 --> 01:01:59.050
Now, Arabic, old Arabic, is clean glasses.

01:01:59.990 --> 01:02:01.100
Old Arabic is what?

01:02:01.600 --> 01:02:02.730
Clean glasses.

01:02:03.100 --> 01:02:04.650
And new Arabic is,

01:02:05.770 --> 01:02:08.310
the new formal Arabic even is still what? Some kind of

