01:02:10.600 --> 01:02:13.330
Now, when you're looking at a diamond with dirty glasses,

01:02:15.200 --> 01:02:17.510
you see something shiny, but it's still dirty,

01:02:18.500 --> 01:02:19.430
not that impressive.

01:02:20.200 --> 01:02:21.930
You look at the same diamond with what?

01:02:23.100 --> 01:02:26.220
Clear glasses. And what do you see? "Oh my God, that's amazing!"

01:02:27.300 --> 01:02:28.230
"That's incredible!"

01:02:29.100 --> 01:02:32.120
The problem is not with the diamond. The problem is with your

01:02:32.700 --> 01:02:33.510
glasses.

01:02:34.200 --> 01:02:37.730
We have to look at the Quran not from formal Arabic,

01:02:38.200 --> 01:02:39.310
but from

01:02:40.000 --> 01:02:44.730
classical Arabic. The problem is classical Arabic died. It died in the desert.

01:02:45.100 --> 01:02:46.720
Thank Allah they protected it.

01:02:47.300 --> 01:02:51.630
So we can go back and dig and find those meetings again. How many meanings I gave you

01:02:51.630 --> 01:02:52.730
of the word aayah today?

01:02:53.400 --> 01:02:56.610
You will not get those meanings of the word aayah in, which Arabic?

01:02:57.400 --> 01:03:00.610
Formal Arabic. You will only get the meaning of the aayah in, what?

01:03:01.300 --> 01:03:02.330
Classical Arabic.

01:03:02.330 --> 01:03:05.130
Because the modern Arab, even if he speaks really good Arabic,

01:03:05.130 --> 01:03:06.520
does not know that Arabic anymore.

01:03:06.520 --> 01:03:08.560
It died. And it's a history study now.

01:03:08.580 --> 01:03:12.930
It is a research study now. So we have to go back and learn that language

01:03:13.700 --> 01:03:17.260
and study that language so we can analyze the Quran with the proper lens.

01:03:18.100 --> 01:03:21.430
This solves huge problems for us. Inshaa'Allah we will see one of these problems

01:03:21.430 --> 01:03:25.270
repeat, and I'll discuss that with you inshaa'Allah ta'aalaa, when the time comes.

01:03:25.270 --> 01:03:26.230
Hopefully tomorrow.

01:03:26.700 --> 01:03:29.080
Hopefully tomorrow. Some interesting discussions are coming tomorrow.

01:03:29.080 --> 01:03:32.760
So it's time now for your well deserved first break.